                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019m proud to have helped secure $202 million for Ohio\u2019s rural hospitals in the Working Families Tax Cuts Act. \n\nOur rural health care providers are some of our communities\u2019 literal lifeline, and having access to local care is the difference between life and death in emergency situations. \n\nThis is a huge step in our mission to make Americans healthier, in addition to supporting these facilities that also commonly serve as the anchor employer in our small towns.\n\nhttps://t.co/jlvuVOJGIV",
